1fd07f8a0","text":"韩王信之后；祖韩术，父韩纯。","evidence":["hancui-q-cf5ec8b4f08a628f7080"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"mingdi-m-o016-mingdi-p0021","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["mingdi-q-o016"]},{"id":"mingdi-m-o060-mingdi-p0021","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["mingdi-q-o060"]},{"id":"mingdi-m-o061-mingdi-p0021","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["mingdi-q-o061"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hancui-q-05b9bfa67a0a4c6d858e","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-76fbca1405bea7521831","layer":"original","quote":"太祖平荆州，辟为丞相士曹属〖1〗。后迁乐陵太守。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":16,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":24},{"id":"hancui-q-2b08e060b00e2219b1e9","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-eead853d8d29889bbf8b","layer":"original","quote":"夏四月，薨；遗令敛以时服，葬为土藏〖7〗。谥曰恭侯。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":28,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":60,"end":86},{"id":"hancui-q-3d2f97d6aff86c76d660","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-fb1e3a98700b8de0128f","layer":"original","quote":"韩暨字公至，南阳堵阳人也〖1〗。﹝一﹞同县豪右陈茂〖2〗，谮暨父兄，几至大辟〖3〗。暨阳不以为言〖4〗，庸赁积资〖5〗，阴结死士；遂追呼寻擒茂，以首祭父墓。由是显名。举孝廉，司空辟；皆不就。乃变名姓，隐居避乱鲁阳山中〖6〗。山民合党，欲行寇掠。暨散家财以供牛酒，请其渠帅〖7〗，为陈安危；山民化之，终不为害。避袁术命召，徙居山都之山〖8〗。荆州牧刘表礼辟，遂遁逃，南居孱陵界〖9〗；所在见敬爱〖10〗，而表深恨之；暨惧，应命，除宜城长〖11〗。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":222},{"id":"hancui-q-3e8b053d5fa1714de5f0","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-76fbca1405bea7521831","layer":"original","quote":"制书褒叹〖5〗，就加司金都尉〖6〗，班亚九卿〖7〗。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":16,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":99,"end":125},{"id":"hancui-q-609732323d6581397dda","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-221c02e3b99b050bd5d1","layer":"original","quote":"文帝践阼，封宜城亭侯。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":27,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":11},{"id":"hancui-q-7ffb99114c2e9ad30a6b","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-fb1e3a98700b8de0128f","layer":"original","quote":"举孝廉，司空辟；皆不就。乃变名姓，隐居避乱鲁阳山中〖6〗。山民合党，欲行寇掠。暨散家财以供牛酒，请其渠帅〖7〗，为陈安危；山民化之，终不为害。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":83,"end":154},{"id":"hancui-q-8e6397a3fe24686f80ea","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-221c02e3b99b050bd5d1","layer":"original","quote":"黄初七年，迁太常，进封南乡（亭）侯，邑二百户。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":27,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":11,"end":34},{"id":"hancui-q-ad2130299f7a6fb00434","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-fb1e3a98700b8de0128f","layer":"original","quote":"同县豪右陈茂〖2〗，谮暨父兄，几至大辟〖3〗。暨阳不以为言〖4〗，庸赁积资〖5〗，阴结死士；遂追呼寻擒茂，以首祭父墓。由是显名。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":19,"end":83},{"id":"hancui-q-ad77a8f841dd8830c664","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-eead853d8d29889bbf8b","layer":"original","quote":"景初二年春，诏曰：“太中大夫韩暨，澡身浴德，志节高洁；年逾八十，守道弥固，可谓纯笃，老而益劭者也〖6〗。其以暨为司徒。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":28,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":59},{"id":"hancui-q-c3a111bad5e593fe2009","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-221c02e3b99b050bd5d1","layer":"original","quote":"时新都洛阳，制度未备；而宗庙主祏﹝一﹞皆在邺都〖1〗。暨奏请迎邺四庙神主〖2〗，建立洛阳庙；四时蒸尝〖3〗，亲奉粢盛〖4〗。崇明正礼，废去淫祀〖5〗，多所匡正。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":27,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":34,"end":114},{"id":"hancui-q-cf5ec8b4f08a628f7080","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-b502934915f3f04c1f0a","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《楚国先贤传》曰：“暨，韩王信之后。祖术，河东太守。父纯，南郡太守。”","attribution":"裴注（引书见原文，待主审复核）","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":15,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-2a4389b2a28e5604c7b6","start":0,"end":38},{"id":"hancui-q-e49dbe6cac3b33efe13e","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-76fbca1405bea7521831","layer":"original","quote":"徙监冶谒者〖2〗。旧时，冶作马排〖3〗，﹝一﹞每一熟石用马百匹〖4〗；更作人排，又费功力。暨乃因长流，为水排；计其利益，三倍于前。在职七年，器用充实。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":16,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":24,"end":99},{"id":"hancui-q-eab955a74fc4395bf27f","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-1b726db7bfd68c19035b","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《楚国先贤传》曰：“暨临终，遗言曰：‘夫俗奢者示之以俭，俭则节之以礼。历见前代送终过制，失之甚矣。若尔曹敬听吾言：敛以时服，葬以土藏；穿毕便葬，送以瓦器。慎勿有增益！’又上疏曰：‘生有益于民，死犹不害于民；况臣备位台司，在职日浅，未能宣扬圣德以广益黎庶？寝疾弥留，奄即幽冥。方今百姓农务，不宜劳役；乞不令洛阳吏民供设丧具。惧国典有常，使臣私愿不得展从。谨冒以闻，惟蒙哀许。’帝得表嗟叹，乃诏曰：‘故司徒韩暨，积德履行，忠以立朝；至于黄发，直亮不亏。既登三事，望获毗辅之助；如何奄忽，天命不永！曾参临没，易箦以礼；晏婴尚俭，遣车降制。今司徒知命，遗言恤民，必欲崇约。可谓善始令终者也。其丧礼所设，皆如故事，勿有所阙。特赐温明秘器，衣一称，五时朝服，玉具剑佩。’”","attribution":"裴注·楚国先贤传","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":39,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-e6f961b5d067b6d449e0","start":0,"end":333},{"id":"hancui-q-ef46f022302d37e0637a","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-221c02e3b99b050bd5d1","layer":"original","quote":"在官八年，以疾逊位。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":27,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":114,"end":124},{"id":"hancui-q-fa3701ce2e69f8a9d595","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-fb1e3a98700b8de0128f","layer":"original","quote":"避袁术命召，徙居山都之山〖8〗。荆州牧刘表礼辟，遂遁逃，南居孱陵界〖9〗；所在见敬爱〖10〗，而表深恨之；暨惧，应命，除宜城长","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":154,"end":217},{"id":"huanchen-q-0eead8a94bea2511cebc","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-34d411f478d6319156f9","layer":"original","quote":"会司徒缺，毓举处士管宁〖28〗；帝不能用，更问其次。毓对曰：“敦笃至行〖29〗，则太中大夫韩暨〖30〗；亮直清方，则司隶校尉崔林〖31〗；贞固纯粹，则太常常林〖32〗。”帝乃用暨","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":545,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":89},{"id":"mingdi-e-o016a-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-7813ae24084c75e21fe4","layer":"original","quote":"初，洛阳宗庙未成，神主在邺庙。十一月，庙始成。使太常韩暨持节迎高皇帝、太皇帝、武帝、文帝神主于邺〖26〗。十二月，己丑至〖27〗，奉安神主于庙〖28〗。﹝一﹞癸卯〖29〗，大月氏王波调遣使奉献〖30〗，以调为亲魏大月氏王。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":90,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":111},{"id":"mingdi-e-o060a-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-2d6d52c90febfeaa96bd","layer":"original","quote":"二月，癸卯〖2〗，以太中大夫韩暨为司徒。癸丑〖3〗，月犯心距星〖4〗；又犯心中央大星。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":435,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":43},{"id":"mingdi-e-o061a-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-f165ec46b1fa65c10705","layer":"original","quote":"夏四月，庚子〖5〗，司徒韩暨薨。壬寅〖6〗，分沛国萧、相、竹邑、符离、蕲、铚、龙亢、山桑、洨、虹﹝二﹞十县〖7〗，为汝阴郡；宋县、陈郡苦县皆属谯郡〖8〗。以沛、杼秋、公丘、彭城丰国、广戚并五县〖9〗，为沛王国。庚戌〖10〗，大赦。五月，乙亥〖11〗，月犯心距星，又犯中央大星。﹝三﹞六月，省渔阳郡之狐奴县〖12〗，复置安乐县〖13〗。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":436,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":167},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-603b9eca40bc72aa5ca9","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-603b9eca40bc72aa5ca9","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：太和三年（公元 229）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":92,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-04d89584b18b3bb50af5","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：景初二年（公元 238 ）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":438,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-917b5dc4aecce5a0dcf4","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"mingdi-q-o013","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-c7981dd3e3485c76d7c8","layer":"original","quote":"三年夏四月〖1〗，元城王礼薨。六月，癸卯〖2〗，繁阳王穆薨。戊申〖3〗，追尊高祖大长秋曰高皇帝，夫人吴氏曰高皇后。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":87,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":57},{"id":"mingdi-q-o016","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-7813ae24084c75e21fe4","layer":"original","quote":"初，洛阳宗庙未成，神主在邺庙。十一月，庙始成。使太常韩暨持节迎高皇帝、太皇帝、武帝、文帝神主于邺〖26〗。十二月，己丑至〖27〗，奉安神主于庙〖28〗。﹝一﹞癸卯〖29〗，大月氏王波调遣使奉献〖30〗，以调为亲魏大月氏王。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":90,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":111},{"id":"mingdi-q-o059","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-5790b2efe14805978c50","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，诏太尉司马宣王。率众讨辽东。﹝一﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":434,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26},{"id":"mingdi-q-o060","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-2d6d52c90febfeaa96bd","layer":"original","quote":"二月，癸卯〖2〗，以太中大夫韩暨为司徒。癸丑〖3〗，月犯心距星〖4〗；又犯心中央大星。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":435,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":43},{"id":"mingdi-q-o061","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-f165ec46b1fa65c10705","layer":"original","quote":"夏四月，庚子〖5〗，司徒韩暨薨。壬寅〖6〗，分沛国萧、相、竹邑、符离、蕲、铚、龙亢、山桑、洨、虹﹝二﹞十县〖7〗，为汝阴郡；宋县、陈郡苦县皆属谯郡〖8〗。以沛、杼秋、公丘、彭城丰国、广戚并五县〖9〗，为沛王国。庚戌〖10〗，大赦。五月，乙亥〖11〗，月犯心距星，又犯中央大星。﹝三﹞六月，省渔阳郡之狐奴县〖12〗，复置安乐县〖13〗。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":436,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":167}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
